---
import PageIntro from "@/components/PageIntro.astro";
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base meta={{ title: "About", description: "How I approach work and life outside it." }}>
	<article class="about-page">
		<PageIntro eyebrow="About" title="Learning on the go and iterating continuously" />
		<p class="about-opening">
			I’m most comfortable where the path is still taking shape—learning quickly, testing assumptions,
			and refining the direction as new information appears.
		</p>
		<div class="about-grid">
			<section>
				<h2>How I work</h2>
				<p>
					I like starting with the underlying problem, getting close to the people living with it, and
					using real-world feedback to decide what deserves to be built.
				</p>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2>Outside work</h2>
				<p>
					I value curiosity, new places, long conversations, and interests that have no obligation to
					become productive.
				</p>
				<a class="text-link" href="/photos/">Photos and places →</a>
			</section>
		</div>
		<p class="about-closing">If any of this resonates, I’d be glad to hear from you.</p>
	</article>
</Base>
